    m_Untranslated: "Enjoy the warm glow of the sun bathing this peaceful oasis. Walk down the sandy hill, and you\u2019ll find a traditional Bedouin tent set up for the night.\n\n<b>Note:</b> When loading this scene for the very first time, you may need to wait several seconds for shader compilation."
